{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify OS 2.0 liquid block called "Collection carousel with static cards". It must match the following design exactly in structure, proportions, shadows, and spacing.
    
    CAROUSEL LAYOUT:
    
    Horizontal scrollable carousel with scroll-snap enabled (scroll-snap-type: x mandatory, scroll-snap-align: start on each card)
    Scrollbar completely hidden
    Gap between cards: controlled by a range setting (min: 4px, max: 40px, default: 10px)
    Carousel wrapper must have padding: 16px on all sides so box shadows are never clipped
    Padding of the carousel wrapper must be a range setting (min: 8px, max: 40px, default: 16px) labeled "Shadow spacing"
    The scroll container must use overflow-x: auto with overflow-y: visible. Do NOT use overflow: hidden anywhere in the carousel or its parent containers
    Smooth scroll behavior
    CARD SIZE:
    
    Card width controlled by a range setting (min: 60%, max: 100%, default: 85%) labeled "Card width"
    All 5 cards must be equal in height, width, and proportions at all times
    CARD DESIGN (identical for ALL 5 cards):
    
    Background color: #ffffff (color picker setting)
    Card border radius: 50px (range setting, min: 0, max: 60px)
    Box shadow: 0px 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2) — soft drop shadow, never clipped
    Shadow opacity controlled by a range setting (min: 0, max: 1, step: 0.05, default: 0.2)
    Image border radius: 50px (range setting, min: 0, max: 60px)
    Image aspect ratio: 4:5 (portrait), object-fit: cover, full width of card
    Internal card padding: 16px
    Content alignment: centered
    CARDS 1–3: Dynamic collection cards Each card has an independent Shopify collection picker. Displays:
    
    Collection featured image (aspect-ratio 4:5, border-radius matches image border radius setting, object-fit: cover)
    Collection title as heading
    Collection description (optional, controlled by a show/hide checkbox toggle)
    A button that links to the collection URL
    CARDS 4–5: Static custom cards (visually identical to collection cards) Each card has its own independent fields:
    
    Image picker (custom uploaded image)
    Text field: custom heading
    Text field: button label
    URL field: custom link for the button No description field needed on these cards. These cards must match cards 1–3 exactly in height, padding, image proportions, shadow, and border radius.
    TYPOGRAPHY — Title (all cards):
    
    Font picker setting (default: Aleo)
    Size range setting (default: 26px)
    Color picker (default: #000000)
    TYPOGRAPHY — Description (collection cards only):
    
    Font picker setting (default: System UI)
    Size range setting (default: 15px)
    Color picker (default: #666666)
    Show/hide checkbox toggle
    BUTTON (shared settings for all 5 cards):
    
    Font picker setting (default: Andada Pro)
    Size range setting (default: 14px)
    Background color picker (default: #dedede)
    Text color picker (default: #000000)
    Hover background color picker (default: #dedede)
    Hover text color picker (default: #aa7d44)
    Border radius range setting (default: 50px)
    Padding: 10px 24px
    CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS:
    
    All 5 cards must look visually identical in structure, height, proportions, shadows, and spacing — only the data source differs
    Box shadows must never be clipped by any parent container
    All key visual properties (card width, shadow spacing, gap, border radii, colors, fonts, sizes) must be editable from the Shopify theme editor
    The block must be fully compatible with Shopify OS 2.0 theme architecture and render correctly in the theme editor preview
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: {{ block.settings.shadow_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: visible;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 {{ block.settings.card_width }}%;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    box-shadow: 0px 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 10.0 }});
    padding: 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.title_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.description_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.description_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.description_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.description_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.button_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 10px 24px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
  }
{% endstyle %}

<collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-collection-carousel-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% for i in (1..3) %}
      {% liquid
        assign collection_key = 'collection_' | append: i
        assign collection = block.settings[collection_key]
      %}
      <div class="ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if collection.featured_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ collection.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
            alt="{{ collection.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
            class="ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="800"
            height="1000"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-collection-carousel-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'collection-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if collection.title != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ collection.title }}</h3>
        {% else %}
          <h3 class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Collection {{ i }}</h3>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.show_description and collection.description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-collection-carousel-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ collection.description }}</div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if collection.url != blank %}
          <a href="{{ collection.url }}" class="ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_label }}
          </a>
        {% else %}
          <a href="#" class="ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_label }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endfor %}

    {% for i in (4..5) %}
      {% liquid
        assign image_key = 'custom_image_' | append: i
        assign heading_key = 'custom_heading_' | append: i
        assign button_label_key = 'custom_button_label_' | append: i
        assign link_key = 'custom_link_' | append: i

        assign custom_image = block.settings[image_key]
        assign custom_heading = block.settings[heading_key]
        assign custom_button_label = block.settings[button_label_key]
        assign custom_link = block.settings[link_key]
      %}
      <div class="ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if custom_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ custom_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
            alt="{{ custom_image.alt | escape }}"
            class="ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="800"
            height="1000"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-collection-carousel-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'collection-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if custom_heading != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ custom_heading }}</h3>
        {% else %}
          <h3 class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Custom Card {{ i }}</h3>
        {% endif %}

        {% if custom_link != blank %}
          <a href="{{ custom_link }}" class="ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if custom_button_label != blank %}
              {{ custom_button_label }}
            {% else %}
              {{ block.settings.button_label }}
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        {% else %}
          <a href="#" class="ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if custom_button_label != blank %}
              {{ custom_button_label }}
            {% else %}
              {{ block.settings.button_label }}
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CollectionCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.scrollContainer = this.querySelector('.ai-collection-carousel-scroll-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
      }
    }

    customElements.define('collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CollectionCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

